From: Shunqing Chen <csq@rock-chips.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Sep 2021 10:56:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 101/232] media: rk628-for-all: get the correct frequency value

Signed-off-by: Shunqing Chen <csq@rock-chips.com>
Change-Id: I09abb6488bc4bc398b128940a18b34b790095c95
Signed-off-by: Guochun Huang <hero.huang@rock-chips.com>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c b/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c
index 03593d6a59761b..718220d34d0a82 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c
@@ -566,6 +566,7 @@ int rk628_rxphy_power_on(struct rk628 *rk628, int f)
 	rk628_control_deassert(rk628, RGU_RXPHY);
 	udelay(10);
 
+	f = f & 0x7fffffff;
 	return rk628_combrxphy_set_hdmi_mode_for_cable(rk628, f);
 }
 
